# Scan output. A report is an inventory of every ungoverned integration on an
# instance, its owner, and its blast radius — i.e. a map of where to attack.
# One was committed to this repo containing real usernames and service-account
# names from a live instance, and survived until a reviewer looked for it.
#
# The patterns below cover the CLI's own default --output value and the
# filenames used in README's quick start, which is where an accidental commit
# is most likely to come from.
report.json
report.html
agentcensus-report.*
live-*.json
live-*.html
*.html
